  "doc": "Cases of the prefab override merge (doc/guide/ecs/game-object-definition.md#prefabs): objects merge key by key, everything else replaces, null sets null. Shared with the VSCode extension (weakpixel/weakpixel-engine-vscode test/fixtures/merge-patch.json): change both.",
